140		<a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
141		<header>
142			<h1>Welcome</h1>
143		</header>
144		<main id="main" tabindex="-1">
145			<p>This is a well-structured, accessible HTML5 document.</p>
146			<p>
147				It uses semantic landmarks, a skip link for keyboard navigation,
148				and CSS that adapts to your light or dark mode preference.
149			</p>
150			<p>
151				Features include improved color contrast for accessibility (WCAG AA compliant),
152				better typography with consistent sizing, and smooth interactions.
153			</p>
154		</main>
155		<footer>
156			<p>&copy; <span id="year">2026</span>. All rights reserved.</p>
157		</footer>
158		<script>
159			document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();
160		</script>
161	</body>
